						</div>
					</section>

					<section
						class="border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/10 rounded-xl p-8 flex flex-col gap-6 rigid-card system-card"
					>
						<div
							class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-800/60 pb-3 mb-1 font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-500"
						>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
								<svg
									xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
									width="11"
									height="11"
									viewBox="0 0 24 24"
									fill="none"
									stroke="currentColor"
									stroke-width="2.5"
									stroke-linecap="round"
									stroke-linejoin="round"
									class="text-emerald-500/90"
									><path d="M12 2v20"></path><path
										d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"
									></path></svg
								>
								<span class="terminal-path"
									>~/case_study/data_flow_map.dot</span
								>
							</div>
							<span>[COMPILED]</span>
						</div>
						<h2
							class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-200 tracking-tight"
						>
							// SYSTEM DATA FLOW
						</h2>

						<div
							class="bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 rounded-lg p-6 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"
						>
							<pre
								class="leading-normal">
 [Unified Intake Controller] ───► [Street Classification Toggle: ACTIVE]
              │
              ├─► [Add Family Member] ──► [Inject Dynamic Relational Form Node]
              │
              ▼
[Leaflet Map Canvas Mount]
              │
    ┌─────────┴─────────┐
    ▼                   ▼
[User Map Pin Click] [Manual Input Vector]
    │                   │
    ▼                   ▼
[Coordinate Capture] ──► [Input Synced & Validated]
                        │
                        ▼
             [Staged Payload Assembly]
             (Populating Dormant Spatial DB Columns)
</pre>
						</div>
